SUMMARY:The Playboy of the Western World
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1317
DESCRIPTION:NT Live Broadcast . The Playboy of the Western World (English
 / 140 mins with interval) by John Millington Synge . Dir. Caitríona McLa
 ughlin . Cast: Nicola Coughlan\, Éanna Hardwicke\, Siobhán McSweeney & 
 others. Pegeen Flaherty’s life is turned upside down when a young man w
 alks into her pub claiming that he’s killed his father. Instead of bein
 g shunned\, the killer becomes a local hero and begins to win hearts\, th
 at is until a second man unexpectedly arrives on the scene. Tickets at Rs
 .500\, Rs.350 & Rs.250 are available online on bookmyshow.com and at the 
 Habitat Programmes desk .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1317
CATEGORIES:film\,cinema
