BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0ba96d9922a450d9@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260725T221423Z
DTSTART:20260808T133000Z
DTEND:20260808T153000Z
SUMMARY:IHC Lok Sangeet Sammelan. Day 1
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1326
DESCRIPTION:IHC Lok Sangeet Sammelan . Day 1. A Tribute to Teejan Bai . F
 olk Tradition of Pandavani by Prabha Yadav \, disciple of Late Jhaduram D
 evangan. An evening devoted to the Vedamati tradition of Pandavani\, the 
 narrative art from Chhattisgarh\, where episodes from the Mahabharata are
  brought to life through strong vocals\, expressive gestures\, and the re
 sonant Ektara. In the Vedamati style\, the performance will focus on the 
 intense episode of Draupadi Cheer Haran . Accompanied by Shiv Nishad (Man
 jira)\, Mohan Patel (Harmonium)\, Lilak Sahu (Tabla)\, Lakshmi Narayan (B
 anjo)\, and Nitesh Yadav (Dafli)\, together offering an experience that i
 s both contemplative and dramatic. Collab. Anwesha Kala Kendra\n\nhttps:/
 /indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1326
CATEGORIES:performance\,music
END:VEVENT
