BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a54477eb36c3eb8d@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260725T221423Z
DTSTART:20260809T133000Z
DTEND:20260809T153000Z
SUMMARY:IHC Lok Sangeet Sammelan. Day 2
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1327
DESCRIPTION:IHC Lok Sangeet Sammelan . Day 2. Pulluvan Pattu by Sree Sank
 aran Memorial Pulluvan Pattu Kala Samithi . A rendition of the ritual art
  of Pulluvan Pattu \, a traditional ritualistic folk music of Kerala that
  propitiates serpent deities through rustic verses drawn from the Mahabha
 rata and Puranic lore. Led by Sathyanarayanan. P \, the performance unfol
 ds through the single-stringed Pulluvan Veena\, the earthen-pot Pulluvan 
 Kudam\, and bell-metal Ilathalam Cymbals\, with an ensemble including Bin
 dhu K. P\, Suresh Babu E\, Sreejith P\, and Sreejil P. Set around the myt
 h of serpents\, this ancient oral tradition is driven by rhythm and percu
 ssive beats. Collab. Anwesha Kala Kendra .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Ev
 ents_details/1327
CATEGORIES:performance\,music
END:VEVENT
